OL,3,GNEWSAMan who let mum die on bathroom
OL,4,Afloor jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who failed to help his
OL,7,F74-year-old mother as she lay for two
OL,8,Fweeks slowly dying on their bathroom
OL,9,Ffloor has been sentenced to
OL,10,Fsix-and-a-half years in prison.
OL,12,FStewart Irwin, from Carlisle, finally
OL,13,Fdialled 999 in the early afternoon of
OL,14,F28 July 2023, and told the call handler
OL,15,Fhis mother's skin had "started to turn
OL,16,Fblue".
OL,18,FCarlisle Crown Court heard paramedics
OL,19,Fwho attended the two-bed Rydal Street
OL,20,Fflat found the pensioner unconscious,
OL,21,Fsemi-naked and malnourished.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
